    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Infarct-type necrosis in uterine leiomyoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "An area of central haemorrhage is surrounded by hyalinized tissue adjacent to a hypercellular band of smooth muscle.",
    "source": "Jennifer A. Bennett",
    "copyright": "",
