    "fileId": 13107,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Apoplectic leiomyoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Around a central area of cell dropout associated with fibrin deposition, the tumour is hypercellular and may be associated with increasing mitotic activity. Notice that away from that area, the appearance of the tumour is that of a typical leiomyoma.",
    "source": "Esther Oliva",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
