    "diagnosis": "Leiomyoma with hydropic change",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Multiple irregular nodules are separated by empty spaces due to watery exudate. The appearance may raise concern for the possibility of intravenous leiomyomatosis. Notice that the tumour is well circumscribed.",
